WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.869
Songs can communicate community values and central messages. Give evidence from

00:00:04.869 --> 00:00:08.264
lyrics and connect the message with everyday choices.

00:00:09.117 --> 00:00:13.767
A singer makes the important word louder. Which feature is used? Answer: Stress

00:00:14.617 --> 00:00:19.582
Explain the central message of a song and describe a real situation that illustrates

00:00:19.582 --> 00:00:20.291
its value.

00:00:21.117 --> 00:00:24.466
Why it works: Stress draws attention to a meaningful word.
